Name: rust-netlink
URL: https://github.com/rust-netlink
Revision: 91e71b69fe8d94a8ae7e2748b0443272c6c3307c
Security Critical: yes

Description:
  The rust-netlink project contains several Rust crates for interacting with the
  NETLINK API. See the individual subdirectories for the crates used by Fuchsia.
  Note that each crate has it's own license, as refered to by each subdirectory's
  README.fuchsia file.

  Each subdirectory is a fork of upstream. At this point, there is no intention of
  re-merging with upstream.

  ---
  `Cargo.lock` in this directory is purely for vulnerability scanning purposes to be routed under rust dependencies. It is not used by the Fuchsia GN build system.
